  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3bc7e21d279e2794da532ab820f58e27, type: 3}
  m_Name: invitation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  speakerName: Lumy
  portrait: {fileID: -6028344193123754203, guid: 3eccbad8c3f48a34293959d573c085dc, type: 3}
  lines:
  - ...Hm? The envelope...
  - This is the address... I guess I really came all this way.
  - '"To Miss Lumy."'
  - '"If this letter has found you, then the mansion has already chosen its guest."'
  - '"There are truths buried within these walls that concern your family."'
  - '"Arrive before midnight."'
  - '"Once the gates close, they will not open again until the debt has been settled."'
  - '"We await your arrival."'
  - '"Sender: The House of Nocturnal."'
  - ...My family?
  - I've never heard of a place called Nocturnal...
  - If this is someone's idea of a joke... they went through a lot of trouble.
  - ...There's only one way to find out.
